  <entry>
    <title>登高</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/4edba05c01.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/4edba05c01.html</id>
    <published>2025-11-01T18:24:20.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-11-01T18:31:27.348Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  北国霜沉白日哀，秋风席卷暮云回。<br>  千山落木天阴下，万里长江地涌来。<br>  久滞殊方同客病，遥悲异代共高台。<br>  伤心故事侵馀鬓，泪眼空怀付一杯。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">北国霜沉白日哀，秋风席卷暮云回。千山落木天阴下，万里长江地涌来。久滞殊方同客病，遥悲异代共高台。伤心故事侵馀鬓，泪眼空怀付一杯。</summary>
    
    
    
