    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  凭君揽袂风前舞，倾尽流觞不知数。<br>  醉倒卧眠芳草，依稀红袖来扶。<br>  暮起飞烟搅絮，殷勤欲送归去。<br>  我道山遥路阻，恐是香车难渡。<br>  凝眉问我家何住？笑指青天月来处。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">凭君揽袂风前舞，倾尽流觞不知数。醉倒卧眠芳草，依稀红袖来扶。暮起飞烟搅絮，殷勤欲送归去。我道山遥路阻，恐是香车难渡。凝眉问我家何住？笑指青天月来处。</summary>
    
    
    
