  <entry>
    <title>咏怀古迹（其五）</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/68621fa.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/68621fa.html</id>
    <published>2025-10-12T10:00:13.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-11-02T01:32:25.895Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  红旗辗转西风里，白草飘零北斗间。<br>  百代分州归一日，双江淹雨抱三山。<br>  石城潮打声还壮，青史云腾墨未翻。<br>  浪里浊清姑不论，兴亡任自辨千般。</p><div class="note success no-icon flat"><p>「一」字·连音变调。</p></div>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">红旗辗转西风里，白草飘零北斗间。百代分州归一日，双江淹雨抱三山。石城潮打声还壮，青史云腾墨未翻。浪里浊清姑不论，兴亡任自辨千般。</summary>
    
    
    
    <category term="文集" scheme="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/categories/%E6%96%87%E9%9B%86/"/>
    
