  <entry>
    <title>漫兴</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/1b532bfd123.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/1b532bfd123.html</id>
    <published>2025-10-02T08:52:22.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-10-02T09:21:19.092Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  ​舟车碌碌马蹄休，岐路萧条野色稠。<br>  美树望回千里合，大河看去两端流。<br>  鸟边风日习空照，人外天山有剩秋。<br>  最恨浮云长漠漠，更驱夜雨满京州。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">​舟车碌碌马蹄休，岐路萧条野色稠。美树望回千里合，大河看去两端流。鸟边风日习空照，人外天山有剩秋。最恨浮云长漠漠，更驱夜雨满京州。</summary>
    
    
    
    <category term="古诗" scheme="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/categories/%E5%8F%A4%E8%AF%97/"/>
    
